ory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G\\)</span> (code-set constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> (computable-enumerability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{EA}_G\\)</span> (definition-target effective-axiomatizability predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}enumerable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{EA}_G(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathrm{Code}_G(T))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}enumerable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{EA}_G(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathrm{Code}_G(T))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EA}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{EA}(T)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>是有效可枚举的</li>\n<li>因为这里的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>已经是闭合理论，断言的是其全部定理的码集c.e.；并未断言某个给定公理集原始递归，也不应把“c.e.”擅自加强成“PR”</li>\n<li>第一不完备性定理要求有效可公理化（等价地，在标准有效演算下其定理集c.e.），同时还要求足够算术强度与相应一致性条件</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EA}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{EA}_G(T)\\)</span>按定义保证存在算法枚举<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>的句子码</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-enumerable-—-Effectively-Enumerable-$\\mathrm{EA}$","text":"df-enumerable — Effectively Enumerable $\\m